  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Offer four unique whole words. One spelling is right. One tap only.",
      "Wrong choices must be near-miss spellings of the same base plus the same ending, not a new word meaning unless it is the silent-e lookalike.",
      "Tier 1 uses CVC plus ing. Make the missed double easy to see next to a wild extra letter.",
      "Tier 2 uses ed or er on grade-two CVC words. Mix a missed double, a triple letter, and a chopped ending.",
      "Tier 3 uses a silent-e base or a two-consonant base. One wrong choice doubles when it should not, or skips the double when it should.",
      "Never write IPA, slash sounds, or letter-name strings as choices. Whole words only.",
      "Keep stems in school, home, food, pets, play, family, or weather. No brands. No real names.",
      "Do not reuse a gold stem. Do not copy inventory question text."
    ]
  },
