  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Four to six word stems. CVC base plus ing. Picture of the action. Wrong choices drop the extra letter or add a wild extra letter.",
    "2": "Grade two stems of four to seven words. Use ed or er. Distractors miss the double, triple the last letter, or chop the ending.",
    "3": "Near misses. Silent-e or two-consonant bases. One choice wrongly doubles. The right choice does not double. Longer stem is fine."
  },
